      "Record the installer source and the chosen Node release line in your setup notes. This matters when a teammate reproduces the environment later: an editor update is usually safe, while changing a Node major version can affect module loading or APIs.",
      "PATH is searched from left to right. Multiple Node installations can therefore produce a correct-looking version from the wrong directory. Compare the shell result with `process.execPath`, remove obsolete entries deliberately and restart the editor before retesting.",
